@host = http://localhost:5201

### Submit (Requester)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/requests
X-User: rina
X-Role: Requester
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Overtime November",
  "amount": 150000
}

### Approve (Approver) - replace id and version
POST {{host}}/api/v1/requests/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/decisions
X-User: budi
X-Role: Approver
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "approve",
  "comment": "ok",
  "expectedVersion": 1
}

### Reject without comment -> 400 COMMENT_REQUIRED
POST {{host}}/api/v1/requests/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/decisions
X-User: budi
X-Role: Approver
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "reject",
  "expectedVersion": 1
}

### List pending
GET {{host}}/api/v1/requests?status=pending
X-User: audit
X-Role: Requester
